Homepage: https://github.com/upchui/Wanderlan
Description: Your LAN at other sites, as if a long network cable ran there: layer 2 over an
 existing connection (GRETAP, VLAN-aware bridge)
 wanderlan puts other sites into your network, as if a long network cable ran
 there: the devices at a second office, a second apartment or a holiday house
 are in the LAN of the main office or of your home, with its DHCP, gateway and
 VLANs. One GRETAP tunnel per peer site, a Linux bridge with VLAN filtering,
 VLAN mappings, MSS clamping and loop protection. It builds no VPN; the sites
 must already reach each other through an existing transport network such as a
 VPN.

